{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p018a","title":"曹丕封拜孟达领新城太守","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p018a-account","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"曹丕封拜孟达领新城太守","evidence":["wendi-e-p018a-q"]},{"id":"wendi-a-p018-argument","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"曹丕手令以仪父、夙沙等为譬喻，阐释招徕之意，不把预测孙刘失众当成已发生结果。","evidence":["wendi-q-p018-argument"]},{"id":"mingdi-e-p007g-account","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"延康元年入见后，曹丕加拜孟达散骑常侍、领新城太守，并回应群臣疑虑。。","evidence":["mingdi-e-p007g-q"]},{"id":"liuliao-a-78b9d20724a6ba5c54b3","label":"正文","text":"文帝善达姿观合三郡领新城太守","evidence":["liuliao-q-5521132a1588dd7b4015"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"封拜","evidence":["wendi-e-p018a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0071","role":"受任","evidence":["wendi-e-p018a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年孟达降后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年孟达降后"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p018a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p018a-q","source_order":[2,87,"P018a"],"order":501}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0071","name":"孟达","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-5521132a1588dd7b4015","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-967b35f4077a1663b327","layer":"original","quote":"魏文帝善达之姿（才容）〔容才〕观〖9〗，以为散骑常侍、建武将军，封平阳亭侯；合房陵、上庸、西城三郡〔立以为新城郡〖10〗，以〕达领新城太守","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69},{"id":"mingdi-e-p007g-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf81d9dfe407ed70c63","layer":"pei","quote":"又加拜散骑常侍，领新城太守，委以西南之任。时众臣或以为待之太猥，又不宜委以方任。王闻之曰：‘吾保其无他，亦譬以蒿箭射蒿中耳。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-680a01f5d7c24c678bdc","start":439,"end":501},{"id":"wendi-e-p018a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f5975fd7b6f7d1d457b0","layer":"pei","quote":"吾前遣使，宣国威灵，而达即来。吾惟《春秋》褒仪父，即封拜达，使还领新城太守。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-92f43ed7b9cf84622836","start":16,"end":54},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-p018-argument","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f5975fd7b6f7d1d457b0","layer":"pei","quote":"近复有扶老携幼首向王化者。吾闻夙沙之民，自缚其君以归神农；豳国之众，襁负其子而入丰、镐。斯岂驱略迫胁之所致哉？乃风化动其情而仁义感其衷，欢心内发使之然也。以此而推，西南将万里无外；权、备，将与谁守死乎？”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-92f43ed7b9cf84622836","start":54,"end":156}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
